---

**Bottom line:**  
The “Polished PD‑Boost‑Center” controller keeps the three ingredients that made the best previous strategy work (pole‑PD, angle‑dependent damping, tiny‑angle bias) while smoothing the aggressive parts (boost, edge repulsion, strong centering) and adding a tiny integral correction. This should give the longest pole‑upright times observed so far.
